[183.036482, "o", "> "]
[183.036509, "o", "## What Gets Checked\r\n"]
[183.036539, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.03657, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.036601, "o", "> "]
[183.036684, "o", "- **File patterns**: `*.pem`, `*.key`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.036715, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.036929, "o", "- **Permission threshold**: 644 or looser (world-readable or group-readable)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.036961, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.037186, "o", "- **Required permissions**: 600 (owner read/write only) or 400 (owner read-only)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037216, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037246, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.037365, "o", "## How This Prevents Future Incidents\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037401, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037431, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.037564, "o", "1. **Normal commits**: Blocked by pre-commit hook\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037594, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.037791, "o", "2. **Commits with --no-verify**: Caught by post-commit hook immediately\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037823, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.037953, "o", "3. **Before pushing**: Blocked by pre-push hook\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.037984, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.038203, "o", "4. **Server-side**: Blocked by pre-receive hook (when pushing to remote)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038239, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.03827, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.038325, "o", "## Testing\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038363, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.038392, "o", "> "]
[183.038456, "o", "To verify the system works:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038488, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038524, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.038557, "o", "```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.038589, "o", "> "]
[183.038732, "o", "# Test 1: Normal commit (should be blocked by pre-commit)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038759, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.038829, "o", "echo \"test\" > test.key\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038859, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.038927, "o", "chmod 644 test.key\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.038959, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039011, "o", "git add test.key\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.039051, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039152, "o", "git commit -m \"test\"  # Should fail\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.039182, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039213, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039415, "o", "# Test 2: Bypass with --no-verify (should be caught by post-commit)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.039447, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039637, "o", "git commit --no-verify -m \"test\"  # Commits but shows security error\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.039668, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.0397, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039774, "o", "# Test 3: Pre-push check\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.039804, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.039957, "o", "# (Ensure any .key/.pem files have secure permissions)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.039988, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.040123, "o", "git push  # Should fail if any keys are insecure\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.040155, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.040188, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.04022, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.040252, "o", "> "]
[183.040352, "o", "## Remediation for Existing Bad Commits\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.040383, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.040414, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.040597, "o", "The deploy.key file permissions have been fixed in the filesystem:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.040628, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.040659, "o", "```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.040688, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.040761, "o", "chmod 600 secrets/deploy.key\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.040793, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.040824, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.040855, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.040883, "o", "> "]
[183.04159, "o", "Note: Git does not track full file permissions (only the executable bit), so the historical commit still shows mode 644 in the git object. However, the working tree now has secure permissions, and all future commits are protected by the multi-layer hook system.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.041627, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.041659, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.041714, "o", "## Recommendations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.041745, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.041776, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.042054, "o", "1. **For CI/CD systems**: Configure jenkins-bot and other automated systems to NOT use `--no-verify`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.042088, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.042341, "o", "2. **For remote repositories**: Install the pre-receive hook on the central Git server\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.042378, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.042655, "o", "3. **Team education**: Inform team about the security policy and why `--no-verify` should not be used\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.042685, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.042906, "o", "4. **Regular audits**: Periodically scan the repository for insecure key files\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.04294, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.04297, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.043051, "o", "## Verification Commands\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.043084, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.043115, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.043145, "o", "```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.043176, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.043266, "o", "# Check all hooks are executable\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.04331, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.043519, "o", "ls -la .git/hooks/ | grep -E '(pre-commit|post-commit|pre-push|pre-receive)'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.04355, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.043581, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.043668, "o", "# Scan for insecure key files\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.043699, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.043986, "o", "find . -type f \\( -name \"*.key\" -o -name \"*.pem\" \\) -exec stat -c \"%a %n\" {} \\; | grep -v \"^600\\|^400\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[183.044017, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[183.04405, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[183.04408, "o", "> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
